{
  "about": "The supervisor marker of service.md One copy (DEC-0057, CT-01), for the kits' ports: how a copy reads FABRIC_SERVICE_SUPERVISOR=<manager> from its environment or --fabric-supervisor <manager> from its argument vector, and how long it may wait for a held lock. supervisorMarker and lockWaitBudgetMs in src/service-supervisor.ts run these; argv[0] is the executable. An argument with no value (followed by nothing, by -- or by another --… flag, which it does not consume) or an empty one is a marker that names no manager, so beside a variable it is a conflict; only an empty variable counts as absent.",
  "managers": [
    "launchd",
    "systemd",
    "task-scheduler",
    "node"
  ],
  "lockWaitMaxMs": 300000,
  "exitStatus": 75,
